;	000000000300088427	;	"<p><b>Hyaluronic Acid Plus</b></p> <p>Hyaluronic Acid, Myristoyl Tripeptide-31, Butylene Glycol, Magnesium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Phenoxyethanol.</p> <p><b>Anti-Aging Moisturizer L22</b></p> <p>Aqua, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Glycerin, Glyceryl Stearate, Jojoba Oil/Macadamia Seed Oil Esters, Squalene, Phytosteryl Macadamiate, Phytosterols, Tocopherol, Cetyl Alcohol, Stearyl Alcohol, Stearic Acid, Butyrospermum Parkii Butter, Vitis Vinifera Seed Oil, Phenoxyethanol, Xanthan Gum, Sodium Hydroxide, Ethylhexylglycerin, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice.</p> <p><b>Radiance Eye Gel</b></p> <p>Hyaluronic Acid, Sodium Polystyrene Sulfonate, Sorghum Bicolor Stalk Juice, Glycerin, Hesperidin Methyl Chalcone, Steareth-20, Dipeptide-2, Palmitoyl Tetra-peptide-7, Albizia Julibrissin Bark Extract, Darutoside, Hydroxypropyl Cyclodextrin, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-38, N-Hydroxysuccinimide, Chrysin, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Phenoxyethanol.</p> <p><b>Vitamin C&E Serum</b></p> <p>Aqua, Butylene Glycol, Polysorbate 20, Magnesium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Phenoxyethanol, Tocopheryl Acetate, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice.</p> <p><b>Balancing Facial Toner</b></p> <p>Aqua, Butylene Glycol, Allantoin, Alcloxa, Chamomilla Recutita (Matricaria) Flower Extract, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin.</p>		"
;	000000000300088428	;	"<p><b>Anti-Aging Super Serum</b></p> <p>Aqua, Glycine Soja (Soybean) Oil, Cetyl Alcohol, Glyceryl Stearate, Myristoyl Tripeptide-31, Butylene Glycol, Magnesium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Caprylic/ Capric Triglyceride, Cetyl Ethylhexanoate, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Butyrospermum Parkii Butter, Ferulic Acid, Vitis Vinifera Seed Oil, Glycerin, Sodium Hydroxide, Lavandula Angustifolia Flower Oil, Allantoin, Ethylhexylglycerin, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice, Tocopheryl Acetate.</p> <p><b>Neck Firming Cream</b></p> <p>Aqua, Glycerin, Helianthus Annuus Seed Oil, Glyceryl Stearate, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Cetyl Alcohol, Cetearyl Alcohol, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Hyaluronic Acid, Cocos Nucifera Oil, Phenoxyethanol, Butyrospermum Parkii Butter, Theobroma Cacao Seed Butter, Dimethyl Sulfone, Caprylic/capric Triglyceride, Cetearyl Glucoside, Squalane, Panthenol, Magnesium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Beeswax, Pentylene Glycol, Carbomer, Citrus Grandis Peel Oil, Xanthan Gum, Carrageenan, Sodium Hydroxide, Ethylhexylglycerin, Tetrahexyldecyl Ascorbate, Polyacrylamide, Citrus Aurantium Dulcis Peel Oil, Polysorbate 20, 3-Aminopropane Sulfonic Acid, Calcium Hydroxymethionine, C13-14 Isoparaffin, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Tocopheryl Acetate, Laureth-7, Dipeptide Diaminobutyroyl Benzylamide Diacetate, Chamomilla Recutita Flower Extract, Glycyrrhiza Glabra Root Extract, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice, Paullinia Cupana Seed Extract, Camellia Sinensis Flower Extract, Calendula Officinalis Flower Extract, Citric Acid.</p> <p><b>Balancing Facial Toner</b></p> <p>Aqua, Butylene Glycol, Allantoin, Alcloxa, Chamomilla Recutita (Matricaria) Flower Extract, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin.</p> <p><b>Day/Night Cream</b></p> <p>Aqua, Glycerin, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Butylene Glycol, Cetearyl Alcohol, Coco-Caprylate/Caprate, Glyceryl Stearate, Dimethicone, Stearic Acid, Cetearyl Olivate, Sorbitan Olivate, Glycerin ,Hydroxypropyl Cyclodextrin, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-38, Sodium Hyaluronate, Panthenol, Glycine, Sorbitol, Glycine Soja Protein, Copper Tripeptide-1, Snail Secreation Filtrate, Oryza Sativa Bran Oil, Simmondsia Chinensis Oil, Polyacrylamide, C13-14 Isoparaffin, Laureth-7, Sodium Hydroxide, Carbomer, Carrageenan, Avena Sativa Kernel Extract, Arnica Montana Flower Extract, Robus Idaeus Fruit Extract, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Anthemis Nobilis Flower Extract, Camellia Sinensis Extract, Panax Ginseng Root Extract, Centella Asiatica Extract, Equinacea Purpurea Extract, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Disodium EDTA.</p> <p><b>Radiance Eye Gel</b></p> <p>Hyaluronic Acid, Sodium Polystyrene Sulfonate, Sorghum Bicolor Stalk Juice, Glycerin, Hesperidin Methyl Chalcone, Steareth-20, Dipeptide-2, Palmitoyl Tetra-peptide-7, Albizia Julibrissin Bark Extract, Darutoside, Hydroxypropyl Cyclodextrin, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-38, N-Hydroxysuccinimide, Chrysin, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Phenoxyethanol.</p> <p><b>Retinol Serum</b></p> <p>Aqua, Butylene Glycol, Retinol, Polysorbate 20, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Hydroxyethyl Cellulose, Potassium Sorbate, Sodium Benzoate, Citric Acid, Tocopheryl Acetate, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice.</p> <p><b>Vitamin C Facial Cleanser</b></p> <p>Aqua, Sodium Lauroyl Methyl Isethionate, Sodium Cocoyl Isethionate, Disodium Cocoamphodiacetate, Glycerin, Decyl Glucoside, Hydroxypropyl Methylcellulose, Panthenol, Polyquaternium-10, Aloe Barbedensis Leaf Juice, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Panax Ginseng Root Extract, Undaria Pinnatifida Extract, Oryza Sativa Bran Oil, Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Caprylyl Glycol, Hexylene Glycol, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin.</p> <p><b>Vitamin C&E Serum</b></p> <p>Aqua, Butylene Glycol, Polysorbate 20, Magnesium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Phenoxyethanol, Tocopheryl Acetate, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice.</p>		"
